@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title GET /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folders/{folder_uuid}
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
Client -> API: 查询
API -> DB: 已被索引 SELECT
note right of DB
  FOLDER 保存一次; USER_FOLDER_BINDING 保存访问,
  计数器和 read-only JSONB folder_items_snapshot; empty=[]
  FOLDER_ITEM = normalized source of truth; snapshot 建造 folder_projection
  自动 FOLDER_ITEM — 恢复的预影
  来源: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + 规范性 STREAM.is_archived = false
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false
end note
DB --> API: 一个 indexed row 没有 ready snapshot/counts
note right of API: 没有 N+1 / json_agg / COUNT / custom SQL
note right of API: 没有 outbox / 任务 / 事件
API --> Client: 200 JSON
@enduml
